`cordis.patch.yml`（由 `install.ps1` 从模板生成）里需要按机器改的只有三处：

```yaml
command: '__PLUGIN_DIR__\runtime\v21\TiaMcpServer.exe'   # 引擎位置
args: [--tia-major-version, '21']                        # 装多版本时必填
env:  { TiaPortalLocation: 'C:\Program Files\Siemens\Automation\Portal V21' }
env:  { TIA_OPENNESS_DIR:  'C:\Program Files\Siemens\Automation\Portal V16\PublicAPI\V16' }
